d shenanigans."},{"r":1403,"d":472,"s":"note","t":"colophon","c":2,"p":null,"l":"","x":"pnpm exec tsx quartz/scripts/dev.ts --bg\n \ntail -f .dev.log\nFor a more compact highlights, see this list\ncourses and lecture workspaces\nI want to explore a spaced repetition interface for some of the "},{"r":1404,"d":472,"s":"note","t":"colophon","c":3,"p":null,"l":"","x":"There are also a bunch of maths and sports physiology in there for maximize human-performance 😸 (i’m just a sucker for data, but it is all fun and game)\nmascots\nVery rudimentary hand-drawn mascot appe"},{"r":1405,"d":472,"s":"note","t":"colophon","c":4,"p":null,"l":"","x":"f to navigate the sites on keyboards.\ngh for navigating ToC (supports j/k/Ctrl-n/Ctrl-p scrolling)\nCmd/Ctrl+&#039; for shortcuts helpers\nCmd/Ctrl+P for the command palette\ngs for the share-card editor"},{"r":1406,"d":472,"s":"note","t":"colophon","c":5,"p":null,"l":"","x":"code \n\n\n```tikz\n\\usepackage{tikz-cd}\n\\begin{document}\n\\begin{tikzcd}\n\\pi^{-1}(U) \\arrow[r, &quot;\\varphi&quot;] \\arrow[d, &quot;\\pi&quot;&#039;] &amp; U \\times F \\arrow[ld, &quot;proj_1&quot;] \\\\\nU &a"},{"r":1407,"d":472,"s":"note","t":"colophon","c":6,"p":null,"l":"","x":"5:Sample w∼Categorical(α)w \\sim \\text{Categorical}(\\alpha)w∼Categorical(α)\n\n6:if w=EOSw = \\text{EOS}w=EOS then\n\n\n7:break\n\n\n8:end if\n\n9:s←append⁡(s,w)s \\gets \\operatorname{append}(s, w)s←append(s,w)\n\n\n"}]